          "quote": "Set $T^{\\mathrm{EM}}_{ab}:=\\mu_0^{-1}(F_{ac}F_b{}^c-\\tfrac14g_{ab}F_{cd}F^{cd})$, $T^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=T^{\\mathrm{EM}}+T^\\varphi$, and $\\kappa_E:=8\\pi G_N/c^4$. The equations of the adopted action model are $$dF=0,\\qquad \\nabla_aF^{ab}=-\\mu_0j^b,\\qquad G_{ab}+\\Lambda g_{ab}=\\kappa_E T^{\\mathrm{tot}}_{ab},\\qquad E_\\varphi=0.$$",
